{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Eio_unix.Resource</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"eio","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Eio_unix","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Resource","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Eio resources backed by an OS file descriptor.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> <span>'a t</span></span><span> = <span><span>(<span>[&gt; `Unix_fd ]</span> <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> 'a)</span> <a href=\"../../Eio/Resource/index.html#type-t\">Eio.Resource.t</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Resources that have FDs are tagged with <code>`Unix_fd</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type extension anchored\" id=\"extension-decl-T\"><a href=\"#extension-decl-T\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> <a href=\"../../Eio/Resource/index.html#type-pi\">Eio.Resource.pi</a> += </span></code><ol><li id=\"extension-T\" class=\"def variant extension anchored\"><a href=\"#extension-T\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"extension\">T</span> : <span><span>(<span class=\"type-var\">'t</span>, <span><span class=\"type-var\">'t</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../Fd/index.html#type-t\">Fd.t</a>, <span>[&gt; `Unix_fd ]</span>)</span> <a href=\"../../Eio/Resource/index.html#type-pi\">Eio.Resource.pi</a></span></span></code></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-fd\"><a href=\"#val-fd\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> fd : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">_</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../Fd/index.html#type-t\">Fd.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>fd t</code> returns the FD being wrapped by a resource.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-fd_opt\"><a href=\"#val-fd_opt\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> fd_opt : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">_</span> <a href=\"../../Eio/Resource/index.html#type-t\">Eio.Resource.t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Fd/index.html#type-t\">Fd.t</a> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>fd_opt t</code> returns the FD being wrapped by a generic resource, if any.</p><p>This just probes <code>t</code> using <a href=\"#extension-T\"><code>T</code></a>.</p></div></div>"}